### **§ 25.58 New and superseding formulas.**

(a) _New formulas._ Except as otherwise provided in paragraph (b) of this section, you must file a new formula (with a new formula number) for approval by TTB if you—

- (1) Create an entirely new fermented

- product that requires a formula;

(2) Add new ingredients to an existing formulation;

(3) Delete ingredients from an existing formulation;

- (4) Change the quantity of an ingre-

- dient used from the quantity or range of usage in an approved formula;

(5) Change an approved processing, filtration, or other special method of manufacture that requires the filing of a formula; or

