(1) _Tax class 5041(b)(1)._ On still wines containing not more than 14 percent alcohol by volume, $1.07, per wine gallon;

(2) _Tax class 5041(b)(2)._ On still wines containing more than 14 percent and not exceeding 21 percent alcohol by volume, $1.57 per wine gallon;

(3) _Tax class 5041(b)(3)._ On still wines containing more than 21 percent and not exceeding 24 percent alcohol by volume, $3.15 per wine gallon;

(4) _Tax class 5041(b)(4)._ On champagne and other sparkling wines, $3.40 per wine gallon;

